WEBVTT

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:10.770
Executioner!

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:12.430
Yo, Akudama.

00:00:12.430 --> 00:00:15.270
Huh, you're alone? Where's the red-eyed one?

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:18.220
Just who I wanted to see!

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:23.390
If I let you guys run amok any longer,
it'll tarnish my name.

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:26.680
This will be a good spot for your graves.

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:31.930
I'm executing all of you!

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:46.680
"Akudama Drive"

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:09.020
"Kansai Police Hospital"
"West Building Room 603"

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:14.680
Master, I know you were hurt.

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:17.270
Why did you leave me behind?

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:20.100
Master!

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:22.470
I'll execute you!

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:24.470
Execute this!

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:27.140
I'm gonna crush you this time!

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:30.770
Sorry, but I'm going all out from the start!

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:35.680
You're nothing more than a brute--

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:36.930
Warning! Warning!

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:37.970
Courier?!

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:42.100
He sure is obsessed with finishing the job.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:44.890
Is that what was inside the vault?

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:58.140
Where are you going?! Wait up, Swindler!

00:02:58.140 --> 00:03:00.180
This might not end well.

00:03:01.350 --> 00:03:03.970
That's right.

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:05.770
It's a dead end.

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:10.020
Now, on to the next one.

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:15.270
Shit! Holy shit!

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:16.310
You guys okay?!

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:17.140
We're fine.

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:20.600
Are you hurt?! Are you bleeding?!

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:22.310
I'm fine.

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:25.470
Thank goodness!

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:27.140
It's fine if we're hurt.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:29.100
--Huh?
--Tsk!

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:31.720
Are you all right, Courier?!

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:34.220
That shithead knocked over my bike!

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:36.100
You're the shithead!

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:39.970
Your bike is a nuisance.

00:03:39.970 --> 00:03:42.350
You're the nuisance, you shit!

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:58.060
Cutthroat!

00:03:58.060 --> 00:04:00.430
Relax. I won't let you die.

00:04:00.430 --> 00:04:01.850
Hey, wait!

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:11.720
Cutthroat!

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:14.680
Get moving!

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:19.640
Now's our chance! Hurry!

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:22.180
"Calling"

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:23.470
"Calling"

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:23.470
Shit!

00:04:24.390 --> 00:04:27.850
There's no mistaking he went after the Akudama.

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:29.770
But where are they?

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:31.640
"Superior's thoughts regarding
North Ward hotel incident"
"No. 658's punishment for acting alone"
"Strategy for eliminating A-Rank Akudama circle"

00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:32.390
"Superior's thoughts regarding
North Ward hotel incident"
"Strategy for eliminating A-Rank Akudama circle"

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:34.020
"Superior's thoughts regarding
North Ward hotel incident"
"Admin 'M' Only"
"Strategy for eliminating A-Rank Akudama circle"

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:36.180
Won't Boss know?

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:44.640
Hot damn, you serious?! Say it ain't so, Bro!

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:47.310
Hey! You're not dead, are you?!

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:51.350
Shit's trying to choke me.

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:54.350
You okay, Bro? You're coughing up blood!

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:59.270
It's just my bowels and ribs!
Plus that old wound opened up.

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:01.720
Isn't that kind of a problem?!

00:05:01.720 --> 00:05:04.100
I'm totally fine, Bro!

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:05.310
Huh?

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:10.430
Oh! The Executioner is busy
dealing with the others!

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:12.600
Let's scram and recover!

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:13.890
--Huh?
--Once you're better,

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:17.310
you can go back and whoop his ass!

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:19.810
I know you can win at your best!

00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:22.430
Trust me! I was serving 500,000,000 years!

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:24.600
So let's fall back for today and--

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:25.810
Hell no.

00:05:25.810 --> 00:05:26.850
Huh?

00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:31.430
I ain't passing up an awesome fight like this!

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:37.390
I see...

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:40.100
That's right... Yeah...

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:40.720
--Huh?

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:42.350
--Damn straight, Bro!
--Huh?

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:44.890
A fight like this won't happen again!

00:05:44.890 --> 00:05:47.270
Let's go whoop that scumbag's ass!

00:05:47.270 --> 00:05:51.640
Hell yeah! Now you're talking, Bro! Let's go!

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:53.720
Huh? What?

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:55.310
W-Wait!

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:06.350
You're holding me up. Die already.

00:06:24.310 --> 00:06:27.220
This is the end of the line for you.

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:31.060
After I kill you, I'm taking
the goods back to safety.

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:32.560
Gah, I'm stuck!

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:37.470
It's anything but safety, Executioner.
You're sending us to Kanto.

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:39.680
That'll suffice for me.

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:44.640
What the...?!

00:06:45.890 --> 00:06:50.680
You cut off your own legs?!
What the hell's your problem?!

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:54.060
Don't you dare touch my angel.

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:55.890
You're disgusting!

00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:59.180
It's time to die! Huh?

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:21.140
Aww! It didn't reach far enough?
It's hard to follow through without legs.

00:07:25.560 --> 00:07:27.890
Red! Red! Red!

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:32.560
Akudama scum!

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:38.470
This can't be! What do I do?!

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:39.720
Tsk!

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:43.350
This can't be! This can't be!

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:45.770
Someone! Someone help!

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:50.020
Um, I think your brother--

00:07:50.020 --> 00:07:51.060
It's fine.

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:52.220
Huh?

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:04.640
You make such a fuss, Swindler.

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:08.680
Honestly, the bigger problem
is that my backpack was broken--

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:12.270
Thank goodness you're alive!

00:08:14.810 --> 00:08:18.890
Regeneration. It'll take more
than that to kill him.

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:22.140
Doctor? Wait, your stomach!

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:25.140
I had to stitch myself back together.

00:08:25.140 --> 00:08:28.720
I thought I was dead for sure, but here I am.

00:08:28.720 --> 00:08:33.600
Anyway, the secret of
the vault is out of the bag.

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:35.930
No wonder Kanto wanted you.

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:38.220
I won't let anyone take 'em!

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:42.600
Cut the holier-than-thou act. It makes me sick.

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:46.390
Besides, I think we can handle this Executioner.

00:08:46.390 --> 00:08:47.390
Huh?

00:08:47.390 --> 00:08:48.810
Give it up!

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:56.140
Now what?

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:58.720
How's that?! You like Bro's tackle?!

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:01.970
Yeah, man...

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:05.810
Good God. How annoying.

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:06.810
Injured?

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:12.890
Being a doctor, I can tell. I watched
how he fought while playing dead.

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:17.560
He's moving sluggishly now
compared to on the <i>Shinkansen</i>.

00:09:17.560 --> 00:09:20.520
I'm positive he's injured.

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:22.640
Do you think we can win?

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:26.270
We don't have to win. Just wear him down.

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:27.350
--But for that, we need to fight.

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:29.310
--My blood's so red.
--But for that, we need to fight.

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:30.720
Don't tell me you--

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:33.680
You're slower than before!

00:09:35.430 --> 00:09:41.060
Who you calling slow? I'm more than
capable of executing all of you--

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:43.810
Look! My legs and belly are better!

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:46.600
Hmm, it kinda hurts though.

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:51.770
But now that I've got legs, I can plant
my feet and stab right through you!

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:54.810
This Doctor's a pain in the ass.

00:09:58.100 --> 00:10:00.560
Why won't you die, maggot?!

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:05.390
Courier!

00:10:05.390 --> 00:10:06.970
Hold on tight.

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:10.970
Courier, we're on!

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:13.060
Huh? Swindler's leaving?!

00:10:13.060 --> 00:10:13.850
You're not--

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:15.390
...going anywhere!

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:27.310
What's wrong? Why the long face
when we're having so much fun?!

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:36.850
Where is Master?!

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:37.680
"Execution Department HQ"
"Monument Hall"

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:37.680
Where is Master?!

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:38.970
"Execution Department HQ"
"Monument Hall"

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:38.970
What does it matter?

00:10:38.970 --> 00:10:39.430
"Execution Department HQ"
"Monument Hall"

00:10:38.970 --> 00:10:39.430
I'm gonna execute the Akudama with him!

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:42.350
I'm gonna execute the Akudama with him!

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:47.390
How dim and childish.

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:52.390
Did you learn nothing while
working together with him?

00:10:52.390 --> 00:10:57.100
Your precious Master has shown he's prepared.

00:10:57.100 --> 00:11:00.970
To carve his name on this monument, that is.

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:06.770
"Kansai Contaminated Ward"
"Abandoned Game Center"

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:11.720
Hey, hey! Quit running from me!

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:13.350
Are you having fun?

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:16.890
Hell yeah I am! But either way...

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:21.680
...I ain't letting anyone get in our way!

00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:30.470
Hey, Executioner. Aren't you enjoying this, too?

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:39.850
Maybe you're right.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:48.270
It's not too bad.

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:53.640
Wh-What happened? Eek!

00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:57.020
Huh?

00:11:57.020 --> 00:11:58.390
Bro?

00:11:58.390 --> 00:12:05.220
Do you know why I changed the
Executioners into a two-man system?

00:12:05.220 --> 00:12:06.100
What?

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:11.350
This monument lists over 1000 members
killed in the line of duty.

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:14.640
Our casualty rate was over 80%.

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:18.140
None of them valued their lives much.

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:24.930
Tasked with the honorable duty of executing
Akudama, they sought out their own deaths.

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:33.020
In that aspect, Executioners
barely differ from Akudama.

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:38.350
But our duty of purging evil
is futile when dead.

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:41.720
So I gave Executioners a reason to live.

00:12:41.720 --> 00:12:45.060
And that's "feelings."

00:12:57.140 --> 00:13:00.770
"Kansai Contaminated Ward"
"Abandoned Amusement Park"

00:12:57.140 --> 00:13:00.770
What's wrong?! Why are you out of breath?!

00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:04.180
"Kansai Contaminated Ward"
"Abandoned Amusement Park"

00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:04.180
You put up more of a fight on the <i>Shinkansen</i>!

00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:08.680
Can't go all out without
your partner or something?!

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:13.560
What a funny thing to say.
It's 'cuz she's gone that I can get serious.

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:18.310
How about you prove it?!
Let's see what you've got!

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:20.390
In a gondola?!

00:13:20.390 --> 00:13:22.720
It's better for a fistfight!

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:33.720
In a master/pupil system, feelings for
the other makes one driven to live.

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:36.470
Occasionally, it does cause problems.

00:13:36.470 --> 00:13:40.470
But that's the biggest difference
between us and Akudama.

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:42.770
Also, our biggest strength.

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:49.060
The drive to live gives birth to
immense power when prepared to die.

00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:53.100
As a result, the casualty rate
has fallen to 30%.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:57.310
Feelings between pupil and master
have improved survival.

00:13:57.310 --> 00:14:00.430
Then all the more reason I have to go there!

00:14:00.430 --> 00:14:02.270
I can't let him die!

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:07.100
Yet he left you behind and went
to execute the Akudama alone.

00:14:09.350 --> 00:14:11.390
It can't be...

00:14:11.390 --> 00:14:15.770
He made his decision. He's prepared to die.

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:24.680
Go and see for yourself--your Master's
determination and strength.

00:15:23.220 --> 00:15:25.020
Bro...

00:15:28.310 --> 00:15:29.680
Master...

00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:44.270
"Kizu Valley"
"Old Kansai Bridge"

00:15:44.430 --> 00:15:48.310
Awesome! This is the best!

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:53.310
Why the hell are you even doing this?

00:15:54.310 --> 00:15:56.850
Because I love it!

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:02.770
Master!

00:16:08.140 --> 00:16:10.270
I see how it is.

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:17.470
It's people like you guys...
that I hate the most!

00:16:44.470 --> 00:16:46.520
Master?

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:48.060
Master!

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:52.850
Master!

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:57.310
I-I'll get you help!

00:17:01.470 --> 00:17:02.680
Huh?

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:40.470
Hello! Bunny here!

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:42.220
'Sup?! It's Shark here!

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:45.680
Shark, hey, Shark! You know about Old Kansai?

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:51.720
Isn't that the city that got abandoned
because of the bomb from the war?

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:58.810
Yup! Yup! The shock wave blew up
the buildings and made it uninhabitable!

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:05.220
The closer you get to the Absolute
Quarantine Zone, the worse it is!

00:19:05.220 --> 00:19:09.270
In the hardest-hit places,
there's literally nothing left!

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:13.680
So scary! What happened to
the people who lived there?

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:17.720
Most of them died on the spot
when the bomb blew up!

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:23.350
I heard some of them fled underground
and still live there to this day!

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:26.470
Apparently, the lost language
they use is a hoot!

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:27.600
A hoot?

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:32.720
But thanks to Kanto running things now,
all y'all are safe and sound!

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:34.220
All y'all?

00:19:36.350 --> 00:19:38.770
Hooray for controlled society!

00:19:38.770 --> 00:19:40.850
Well, until next time!

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:43.640
"The End"
"Produced by
Kansai"

00:19:46.850 --> 00:19:48.020
"Kansai East Ward"
"Scrap Metal Yard"

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:50.560
So this is your destination?

00:19:50.560 --> 00:19:53.350
It kinda is, but it kinda isn't.

00:19:53.350 --> 00:19:54.970
You're so obnoxious.

00:19:54.970 --> 00:19:57.220
001003.

00:19:57.220 --> 00:19:57.890
Huh?

00:19:57.890 --> 00:19:59.970
Just be patient, all right?

00:19:59.970 --> 00:20:05.520
This would be much easier with
my backpack, but Cutthroat broke it.

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:12.140
I wonder if it'll rain again...

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:13.310
Cutthroat.

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:14.220
Huh?

00:20:14.220 --> 00:20:17.810
Why did you use Brother as a shield?

00:20:17.810 --> 00:20:21.180
What? If I hadn't, you would've been killed.

00:20:21.180 --> 00:20:22.390
But still--!

00:20:22.390 --> 00:20:25.140
C'mon, it's you we're talking about.

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:27.850
Your life is more beautiful than anything--

00:20:36.430 --> 00:20:37.770
Huh?

00:20:39.310 --> 00:20:41.100
You're despicable.

00:20:42.180 --> 00:20:43.020
Found it.

00:20:43.020 --> 00:20:43.560
"Rotate"
"Stand back if not operating."
"Emergency Use"

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:46.220
"Rotate"
"Stand back if not operating."
"Emergency Use"

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:46.220
This lever will open the entrance.

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:49.140
The entrance? The entrance to what?

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:50.850
001003.

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:52.470
That's not helping.

00:20:52.470 --> 00:20:54.310
I'll show you.

00:21:01.680 --> 00:21:02.970
That's...

00:21:05.140 --> 00:21:10.060
001003... are underground coordinates.

00:23:44.600 --> 00:23:45.770
"The City of Lost Children"

00:23:45.770 --> 00:23:47.020
"The City of Lost Children"

00:23:45.770 --> 00:23:47.020
This is goodbye.
